444
00:28:15,861 --> 00:28:17,337
Lane!

445
00:28:21,778 --> 00:28:23,168
Lane!

446
00:28:30,093 --> 00:28:31,488
Lane!

447
00:28:34,576 --> 00:28:36,492
Meu Deus, cadê ele?

448
00:28:38,524 --> 00:28:40,028
Lane!

449
00:28:41,366 --> 00:28:42,877
Lane!

450
00:28:49,173 --> 00:28:50,504
Lane!

451
00:29:01,534 --> 00:29:03,254
Você viu a árvore
que caiu?

452
00:29:03,628 --> 00:29:05,453
Parece que caiu
aqui perto.

453
00:29:06,129 --> 00:29:08,009
Sim, mas...

454
00:29:08,548 --> 00:29:11,006
